WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.120
<v Narrator><i>The fleet enters a narrow harbor ringed by cliffs.</i>

2
00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:14.850
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus alone moors outside.</i>

3
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.380
<v Narrator><i>Your parents' house.</i>

4
00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:27.230
<v Narrator><i>The queen summons Antiphates, who seizes and eats one scout.</i>

5
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:34.760
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus cuts his cable and escapes with only his own ship.</i>
